  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Program description</h2>
    <p>Greg Jones (the registered brand name) runs a personal assistant program that sends text messages on his behalf. It texts Greg and one family member with reminders and confirmations they asked for, and exchanges short conversational texts with people Greg knows to coordinate plans he started, such as finding a time to meet. All conversations are started by Greg. The program never sends marketing or promotional messages.</p>

    <h2>Consent</h2>
    <p>You receive messages because you gave your number to Greg and he told you his assistant would text you, or because he added the assistant's number to a group text with you. The first message to you identifies the sender as Greg Jones's assistant.</p>

    <h2>Message frequency</h2>
    <p>Message frequency varies with the conversation. Across everyone, the program sends fewer than 100 messages per month.</p>

    <h2>Cost</h2>
    <p>Message and data rates may apply. Check with your mobile carrier for details.</p>

    <h2>Opting out and getting help</h2>
    <p><strong>Reply STOP to any message to stop receiving texts.</strong> You will get one confirmation that you have been unsubscribed, and nothing further.</p>
    <p><strong>Reply HELP for help</strong>, or email <a href="mailto:admin@gregjones.io">admin@gregjones.io</a>.</p>

    <h2>Support</h2>
    <p>Greg Jones, <a href="mailto:admin@gregjones.io">admin@gregjones.io</a>.</p>

    <h2>Carriers</h2>
    <p>Carriers are not liable for any delayed or undelivered messages.</p>

    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>How your information is handled is described in the <a href="/milo/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>.</p>
